1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,140
I'm Eddie Zhang.
我是 Eddie Zhang。

2
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:16,020
In the next ten minutes, I'll show you how a small company can run orders, stock, purchasing and quality from one record.
接下来十分钟，我给您看：一家小公司，怎样用一份记录管好订单、库存、采购和质量。

3
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:20,158
AI drafts. People decide.
AI 起草，人来决定。

4
00:00:20,558 --> 00:00:28,094
Everything you'll see is a working replica, with a fictional company called Harbor Lane Supply.
下面看到的都是可以操作的复制品，用的是一家虚构的公司：Harbor Lane Supply。

5
00:00:29,014 --> 00:00:34,434
Let's start with a Tuesday. A customer asks about a late order.
先说一个周二。客户问一张迟到的订单。

6
00:00:35,734 --> 00:00:44,114
The facts all exist. The order is in the ERP, and the shortage is in a spreadsheet.
事实都在：订单在 ERP 里，缺料在表格里。

7
00:00:45,414 --> 00:00:51,514
The supplier's delay is in someone's inbox. The failed inspection is on paper.
供应商延期在某个人的邮箱里，检验不合格记在纸上。

8
00:00:51,914 --> 00:00:56,472
Nobody can see the chain. So you spend the morning on the phone.
可没人看得见这条链。于是一上午都在打电话。

9
00:00:58,292 --> 00:01:03,724
Today, every record lives in its own tool, owned by one person.
现在，每份记录都在各自的工具里，归一个人管。

10
00:01:05,024 --> 00:01:10,513
We don't ask anyone to type things twice. We connect what you already have.
我们不让任何人重复录入，只把您已有的连起来。

11
00:01:12,333 --> 00:01:18,673
Then there's audit week, when evidence is hunted down at the last minute.
还有审核周：证据临时到处找。

12
00:01:19,973 --> 00:01:28,033
And there are the new AI tools. They are fast, but nobody can check where the answers came from.
还有新的 AI 工具：快是快，可谁也查不了答案从哪来。

13
00:01:29,853 --> 00:01:41,233
Here is the whole design. At the bottom is ERPNext, a mature open-source ERP, used as it is.
整个设计就这样。最底下是 ERPNext，成熟的开源 ERP，原样使用。

14
00:01:42,533 --> 00:01:49,533
On top sits our operations hub. It reads the records, connects them, and checks them.
上面是我们的运营中枢：读取记录，把它们连起来，并检查它们。

15
00:01:51,353 --> 00:01:56,773
One rule runs through everything. AI drafts, and people sign.
有一条规则贯穿始终：AI 起草，人签字。

16
00:01:58,073 --> 00:02:05,071
Ask the AI for a report. It writes from your records, with citations.
让 AI 写报告，它照您的记录写，并注明出处。

17
00:02:06,371 --> 00:02:10,191
Now ask it to sign. It is refused, every time.
再让它签字：拒绝，每一次都拒绝。

18
00:02:12,011 --> 00:02:18,191
First, the base. An ERP is your single book of record.
先说底座。ERP 是公司唯一的账本。

19
00:02:19,491 --> 00:02:28,380
There is one list of items, customers and suppliers, and every transaction is posted once.
一份物料、客户、供应商清单，每笔业务只记一次。

20
00:02:28,780 --> 00:02:33,446
Ship one order, and watch what moves.
发一张货，看看什么跟着动。

21
00:02:35,266 --> 00:02:44,166
ERPNext already covers the whole company: accounting, stock, buying, selling, manufacturing and more.
ERPNext 已经覆盖整个公司：会计、库存、采购、销售、生产等等。

22
00:02:45,466 --> 00:02:51,552
Accounting stays in ERPNext, where your accountant expects it.
会计留在 ERPNext 里，会计习惯的地方。

23
00:02:52,852 --> 00:02:59,101
Quality is where we add the most. We build the full quality system on top.
质量是我们加得最多的地方：我们在上面建了完整的质量体系。

24
00:03:00,921 --> 00:03:04,424
Every document posts balanced entries.
每张单据都记一笔平衡的账。

25
00:03:05,724 --> 00:03:13,224
Receive the goods, pay the supplier, and ship to the customer. Stock and cost of goods move together.
收货、付供应商、发货给客户：库存和销货成本一起动。

26
00:03:14,524 --> 00:03:18,124
Invoice, get paid, and the books stay balanced.
开票、收款，账始终平衡。

27
00:03:19,424 --> 00:03:24,525
Your accountant and your warehouse finally read the same numbers.
会计和仓库终于看的是同一组数。

28
00:03:25,445 --> 00:03:34,665
Stock is kept by warehouse, and goods on quality hold are kept apart from what you can sell.
库存按仓库分开，质量冻结的货和能卖的货分开放。

29
00:03:35,965 --> 00:03:40,585
Batch and serial numbers are how a recall finds every customer.
批号和序列号，是召回时找到每一位客户的依据。

30
00:03:40,985 --> 00:03:49,965
When an item falls below its reorder level, one click drafts a purchase order. It waits for a person.
物料低于补货点，点一下就起草采购单。它等人来确认。

31
00:03:51,785 --> 00:04:00,827
Now the heart of the product: the operations hub. It is built and running today, on top of ERPNext.
现在讲产品的核心：运营中枢。它已经做好、在运行，架在 ERPNext 之上。

32
00:04:02,127 --> 00:04:11,147
Every few minutes it reads what changed in ERPNext, and it never writes back on its own.
它每隔几分钟读取 ERPNext 里变动的记录，自己从不写回。

33
00:04:12,447 --> 00:04:17,464
It turns those changes into measures, with formulas anyone can check.
它把这些变动算成指标，公式人人可查。

34
00:04:18,764 --> 00:04:23,461
And it finds what went wrong, together with the cause.
它还找出哪里出了问题，并给出原因。

35
00:04:25,281 --> 00:04:31,781
Inside, the hub keeps one connected picture of the business, across eight areas.
中枢内部，把整个业务连成一张图，分八个领域。

36
00:04:33,081 --> 00:04:40,221
Click an item, and you see its orders, its stock and its inspections.
点一个物料，就看到它的订单、库存和检验。

37
00:04:41,521 --> 00:04:46,374
Click a purchase order, and you see the supplier and the receipt.
点一张采购单，就看到供应商和收货。

38
00:04:48,194 --> 00:04:55,134
This is the wall display, for the shop floor or the office screen.
这是车间或办公室大屏上的看板。

39
00:04:56,434 --> 00:05:05,901
The numbers move as the records change. On-time delivery, stock-outs, inspections, all live.
数字随记录实时变化：准时交付、缺货、检验，全是实时的。

40
00:05:06,821 --> 00:05:12,001
And this is the morning dashboard, the first screen you open each day.
这是每天早上第一眼看的看板。

41
00:05:13,301 --> 00:05:21,281
On-time delivery, late orders, stock-outs, inventory value and days on hand.
准时交付率、迟到订单、缺货、库存金额和库存天数。

42
00:05:21,681 --> 00:05:25,730
Supplier on-time rate, and open nonconformances.
供应商准时率，还有未关闭的不合格品。

43
00:05:26,130 --> 00:05:31,470
Every tile opens to the records behind it. Let's click late orders.
每一格都能点开背后的记录。我们点开迟到订单。

44
00:05:33,290 --> 00:05:39,923
Every number on that dashboard has a published formula you can check by hand.
看板上每个数都有公开的公式，可以自己手算核对。

45
00:05:41,223 --> 00:05:47,420
Change which orders count, and on-time delivery changes with them.
改一下计入哪些订单，准时交付率跟着变。

46
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:55,962
When there is no data, it says unknown. Never zero, and never a guess.
没有数据时，它显示“未知”。不写零，也不猜。

47
00:05:57,782 --> 00:06:00,676
Now, back to Tuesday.
现在，回到那个周二。

48
00:06:01,976 --> 00:06:07,396
Click the late order, and the hub follows the chain for you.
点开迟到的订单，中枢替您顺着链往下找。

49
00:06:08,696 --> 00:06:13,636
The item is short, because the purchase order arrived six days late.
物料缺了，因为采购单晚到了六天。

50
00:06:14,936 --> 00:06:18,676
What used to take a morning now takes a minute.
过去要一上午，现在一分钟。

51
00:06:19,596 --> 00:06:21,656
The fix comes back as a draft.
解决办法以草稿的形式回来。

52
00:06:22,956 --> 00:06:28,349
It might be a purchase order, or a note to the customer.
可能是一张采购单，也可能是一封给客户的说明。

53
00:06:29,649 --> 00:06:36,389
Nothing reaches ERPNext until a person clicks confirm.
人不点“确认”，什么也进不了 ERPNext。

54
00:06:38,209 --> 00:06:40,829
The assistant sits on every page.
助手在每一页都在。

55
00:06:42,129 --> 00:06:49,789
Ask which orders are late, and why. It answers from your records and cites every one.
问它哪些订单迟了、为什么。它照您的记录回答，每条都注明出处。

56
00:06:51,089 --> 00:06:53,669
Every run is logged.
每次运行都留记录。

57
00:06:54,589 --> 00:06:59,569
For you, the owner, there is the finance board.
给老板的，是财务看板。

58
00:07:00,869 --> 00:07:08,149
What you invoiced this week, who owes you, what is overdue, and what you owe next.
这周开了多少票，谁欠您钱，哪些逾期，接下来要付多少。

59
00:07:08,549 --> 00:07:16,917
It reads ERPNext's own invoices, so it matches your accountant to the cent.
它读的就是 ERPNext 里的发票，所以和会计一分不差。

60
00:07:17,837 --> 00:07:21,977
Quality is where most small companies drown.
质量是多数小公司最吃力的地方。

61
00:07:23,277 --> 00:07:36,018
Here, a standard like ISO 9001 or 13485 becomes checks that read your records every day.
在这里，ISO 9001、13485 这样的标准，变成每天读取实际记录的检查。

62
00:07:36,418 --> 00:07:43,013
Green means today's records satisfy it. Red names the exact record that doesn't.
绿色：今天的记录满足要求。红色：直接指出是哪一条不满足。

63
00:07:44,833 --> 00:07:48,528
A nonconformance follows its workflow.
不合格品按流程走。

64
00:07:49,828 --> 00:07:52,791
First, contain it and sign.
先隔离，签字。

65
00:07:54,091 --> 00:07:56,431
Then propose a disposition.
再提出处置意见。

66
00:07:57,731 --> 00:08:01,698
Now try to approve your own disposition. It is refused.
想自己批自己的处置？拒绝。

67
00:08:02,998 --> 00:08:07,338
Someone else must approve, and the history can only grow.
必须由另一个人批，记录只增不改。

68
00:08:08,258 --> 00:08:10,638
This is an incoming inspection.
这是一次来料检验。

69
00:08:11,938 --> 00:08:17,777
Type a reading out of tolerance, and it turns red at once.
输入一个超差读数，立刻变红。

70
00:08:19,077 --> 00:08:23,778
The verdict comes from code, not from the AI.
判定由程序给出，不由 AI 决定。

71
00:08:24,698 --> 00:08:29,035
Signed inspections feed the control charts.
签过字的检验数据进入控制图。

72
00:08:30,335 --> 00:08:37,395
When the process shifts, a point turns red before bad parts pile up.
工序一偏，点就变红，赶在废品堆起来之前。

73
00:08:38,695 --> 00:08:43,938
One click opens a nonconformance report from that signal.
点一下，就从这个信号开出不合格报告。

74
00:08:45,759 --> 00:08:48,458
Now, medical devices.
再看医疗器械。

75
00:08:49,758 --> 00:08:57,618
Scan the label. The device identifier, the lot and the expiry date are read and checked.
扫一下标签：器械标识、批号、有效期读出来并校验。

76
00:08:58,918 --> 00:09:02,578
Then the lot is traced to every shipment.
再把这一批追到每一次发货。

77
00:09:04,398 --> 00:09:09,019
A supplier warns that a lot of boxes may be bad.
供应商提醒：有一批纸箱可能有问题。

78
00:09:10,319 --> 00:09:17,318
Trace it forward, to the lots that used it, the deliveries, and the customers.
往下追：用了它的生产批、发出的货、收货的客户。

79
00:09:18,618 --> 00:09:25,027
Start a mock recall from the same screen, and record who confirmed it.
在同一个画面发起模拟召回，记下谁确认的。

80
00:09:26,847 --> 00:09:31,347
Machines connect too, each with its own key.
设备也能接进来，每台有自己的钥匙。

81
00:09:32,647 --> 00:09:39,187
A reading from a machine lands in an inbox, and it waits.
设备发来的读数先进收件箱，等着。

82
00:09:40,487 --> 00:09:46,738
A person accepts it, and it joins the inspection. A machine never signs.
人接收后，它才进入检验记录。设备永远不签字。

83
00:09:48,558 --> 00:09:50,909
And this is where it leads.
这就是它通向的地方。

84
00:09:52,209 --> 00:09:59,423
A factory where the warehouse, the robots, vision inspection and every gauge feed one hub.
一座工厂：仓库、机器人、视觉质检、每一件量具，都汇入同一个中枢。

85
00:10:00,343 --> 00:10:09,643
At the inspection station, vision reads each part's code and measures it against the drawing.
质检站上，视觉系统读每个零件的码，按图纸测量。

86
00:10:10,943 --> 00:10:14,363
Bad parts are set aside automatically.
不合格的自动隔离。

87
00:10:15,283 --> 00:10:25,175
The measuring machine, a five-axis scanner, the roughness tester and every hand gauge report in by themselves.
三坐标、五轴扫描仪、粗糙度仪和每一把手持量具，都自己报数。

88
00:10:26,475 --> 00:10:30,755
A gauge past its calibration date is refused.
过了校准期的量具，读数不收。

89
00:10:31,675 --> 00:10:36,255
The loop closes with a person approving at the key step.
闭环里，关键一步由人确认。

90
00:10:37,555 --> 00:10:42,803
That is the vision. And every step toward it runs on the same record.
这是愿景。而通往它的每一步，都跑在同一份记录上。

91
00:10:43,723 --> 00:10:52,033
It's yours to run. ERPNext is open source, with no per-user licences.
平台归您自己运行。ERPNext 是开源的，不按人头收许可费。

92
00:10:53,333 --> 00:10:59,629
The platform runs on a server you control, and your data stays yours.
平台装在您掌控的服务器上，数据归您。

93
00:11:00,029 --> 00:11:05,951
We teach your people, and we offer hosted connections when you need them.
我们教会您的人，需要时提供托管接口服务。

94
00:11:07,771 --> 00:11:13,871
Don't switch everything at once. Import your data, and put one module live.
不用一次全换。先导入数据，上线一个模块。

95
00:11:15,171 --> 00:11:19,846
Usually that's incoming inspection or nonconformance. Then grow.
通常是来料检验或不合格品。再一步步扩。

96
00:11:21,666 --> 00:11:25,236
One record. AI drafts. People decide.
一份记录，AI 起草，人来决定。

97
00:11:26,536 --> 00:11:35,556
We're inviting a small number of pilot companies. If that Tuesday sounded familiar, let's talk.
我们正在邀请少数试点企业。如果那个周二听着耳熟，我们聊聊。
